---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Improved Navigation">
  <div>
    <h1>Navigation Improvements ✨</h1>
    
    <div>
      <h3>✅ Changes Applied</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Removed "Systems"</strong> from primary navigation</li>
        <li><strong>Renamed "Lessons"</strong> to "Learn" (more action-oriented)</li>
        <li><strong>Streamlined navigation</strong> for better focus</li>
        <li><strong>Moved Systems</strong> to footer Resources section</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🧭 New Navigation Structure</h2>
    
    <div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>🏠</div>
          <div>Home</div>
        </div>
        <div>→</div>
        <div>
          <div>🚀</div>
          <div>Start Here</div>
        </div>
        <div>→</div>
        <div>
          <div>📚</div>
          <div>Learn</div>
          <div>New!</div>
        </div>
        <div>→</div>
        <div>
          <div>⚙️</div>
          <div>Setup</div>
        </div>
        <div>→</div>
        <div>
          <div>ℹ️</div>
          <div>About</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🎯 Why This Works Better</h2>
    
    <div>
      <div>
        <h3>🧠 Cognitive Load Reduction</h3>
        <p>5 main navigation items instead of 6 reduces decision paralysis and makes the interface cleaner.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3>🎯 Action-Oriented Language</h3>
        <p>"Learn" tells users what they'll <em>do</em>, while "Lessons" describes what they'll <em>see</em>. Users prefer action verbs.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3>📍 Systems Still Accessible</h3>
        <p>Systems moved to footer "Resources" section and can be accessed within the Learn section - no functionality lost!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🔍 Where to Find Systems Now</h2>
    
    <div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>1</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Footer → Resources → "All Systems"</strong><br>
            <span>Complete systems overview page</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>2</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Footer → "Popular Systems"</strong><br>
            <span>Quick links to C64, Spectrum, NES, Amiga</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <div>3</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Learn → "By System"</strong><br>
            <span>System-organized lesson paths</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p>
        <strong>Result:</strong> Cleaner navigation focused on user goals while maintaining full access to all content!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>